<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bonnita says weighing transaction.</title>
<headline>Bonnita says weighing transaction.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Bonnita Holdings Ltd said on Friday it was at the preliminary stage of investigating a potential transaction and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
